<view wx:if="{{stage === 'handoff'}}" class="screen handoff"><button class="screen-back" bindtap="onResume">‹ 继续修改画作</button><view class="handoff-icon">☻ ↗ ☻</view><view class="handoff-title">现在，把手机<view>交给另一位。</view></view><view class="handoff-desc">画作已经准备好。<view>让 TA 猜猜，今天画的是哪道餐品？</view></view><view class="sealed">✦ 餐品答案已藏好 ✦</view><button class="primary" bindtap="onStartGuess">我接到了，开始猜 ↗</button><view class="micro-note">传手机双人模式 · 无需创建房间</view></view>
<view wx:elif="{{stage === 'guess'}}" class="screen"><button class="screen-back" bindtap="onEnd">‹ 结束本轮</button><view class="draw-heading"><text class="draw-title">这道好吃的，你猜？</text><text class="round-badge">双人 · 猜画回合</text></view><view class="page-subtitle">只看画，不偷看答案。猜错也可以继续试。</view><view class="guess-art"><image src="{{previewFile}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view><label class="sheet-label" for="guessInput">你觉得画的是什么？</label><input id="guessInput" class="guess-input" placeholder="输入餐品名称，例如：薯条" maxlength="40" value="{{guess}}" bindinput="onGuessInput" bindconfirm="onGuess" confirm-type="done"/><view class="guess-feedback">{{feedback}}</view><view class="guess-actions"><button class="secondary" bindtap="onReveal">揭晓答案</button><button class="primary" bindtap="onGuess">猜一下 ↗</button></view><view class="guess-hint">{{attempts ? '已经猜了 ' + attempts + ' 次，再大胆一点。' : '画得像不像不重要，心有灵犀才有趣。'}}</view></view>
<view wx:elif="{{stage === 'reveal'}}" class="screen reveal"><view class="reveal-header"><view class="confetti">✳ ✦ ✳</view><view class="reveal-title">{{correct ? '默契，满分！' : '原来画的是它！'}}</view><view class="reveal-desc">又多了一张，属于你们这一餐的小纪念。</view></view><view class="guess-art"><image src="{{previewFile}}" mode="aspectFit"/></view><view class="reveal-answer"><image wx:if="{{meal.imageUrl}}" src="{{meal.imageUrl}}" mode="aspectFit" binderror="onImageError"/><view wx:else class="image-placeholder compact">暂无参考图</view><text>{{meal.name}}</text></view><button class="primary" bindtap="openSave">把这一轮存进画册 ↗</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="onSwap" disabled="{{saving}}" loading="{{saving}}">交换角色，再画一轮</button><view class="micro-note">交换角色前会先保存本轮画作，默认仅自己可见。</view></view>
<view wx:if="{{showSave}}" class="shade" bindtap="closeSave"><view class="sheet" catchtap="stop"><button class="sheet-close" bindtap="closeSave">×</button><view class="sheet-title">把今天，存进画册。</view><image class="save-preview" src="{{previewFile}}" mode="aspectFit"/><label class="sheet-label" for="artTitle">给这张画起个名字</label><input id="artTitle" class="title-input" maxlength="30" value="{{title}}" bindinput="onTitle"/><view class="consent-line"><switch class="consent-switch" color="#ce4335" checked="{{allowPublic}}" bindchange="onConsent"/><view>允许这张画在对应餐品旁公开展示<text class="consent-desc">仅关联「{{store.name}} · {{meal.name}}」。可随时撤回。原型仅在当前设备模拟。</text></view></view><button class="primary" bindtap="onSave" loading="{{saving}}" disabled="{{saving}}">保存到我的画册 ↗</button><view class="micro-note">不开启，就是仅自己可见。</view></view></view>
